{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26625","headline":"寄王度居士 · 姚合","name":"寄王度居士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顦顇王居士，颠狂不称时。\n天公与贫病，时辈复轻欺。\n茅屋随年借，盘飡逐日移。\n弃嫌官似梦，珍重酒如师。\n无竹栽芦看，思山叠石爲。\n静窗留客话，古寺觅僧棊。\n瘦马寒来死，羸童饿得痴。\n唯应寻阮籍，心事远相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}